*----------------------------------------------------- 1723 span_replace_1 XFAIL
X=SPAN(X) self-rebind (a variable rebound to a pattern built over its own former value) is an inert pattern in SCRIP: the replacement removes nothing. Root of the s183 BLANKS silent wrong answer. Known, root-caused, still-open defect -- FINDING-2026-08-20-s186 section1.
*----------------------------------------------------- 1724 span_replace_2 XFAIL
